    {
      "evidence_id": "E0010",
      "content": "Double/Debiased Machine Learningは、高次元nuisance parameterをMLで推定する際のregularization biasとoverfittingの影響を、Neyman-orthogonal scoreとcross-fittingによって抑え、低次元causal/treatment parameterの推定・推論を行う。",
      "source_locator": "Summary / Abstract",
